 <h3><u>Bol rahi hai zainab</u></h3> 
 <div style=width:100%> 
  <p></p>
  <p>Khatm hai fasl e kamaa bol rahi hai zainab..(3)<br> Kaun boleyga jahaa bol rahi hai zainab.</p> 
  <p>1. Teer o shamsheer o sina hoke sitam ke lashkar..(2)<br> Thak gayi sab ki zabaa bol rahi hai zainab.</p> 
  <p>2. Muddato baad sunaa phirse ali ka lehjaa..(2)<br> Kaisey jhoomey na azaa bol rahi hai zainab.</p> 
  <p>3. Chun rahaa hai adab e nahj e balagha lafze..(2)<br> Apne baba ki zabaan bol rahi hai zainab.</p> 
  <p>4. Hogayi jeet bahattar(72) shohadaa ki saabit..(2)<br> Leke gaazi ka nishaan bol rahi hai zainab.</p> 
  <p>5. Aye yazeed isse badi haar teri kya hogi..(2)<br> Wo tera ghar hai jahaan bol rahi hai zainab.</p> 
